  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DO NOT USE Core Support to the Global Financing Facility for Women, Children and Adolescents (Non-ICF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 3 of this programme will support the Global Financing Facility (GFF) to improve reproductive, maternal, newborn, child and adolescent health and nutrition (RMNCAH-N). This programme will enable low- and low-middle-income countries invest in primary health care systems for women and girls and increase the amount and efficiency of funding to health.</narrative>
  </description>
